{"version":1,"key":"card:70","content":{"id":70,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"mkdir","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以创建一个空文件夹"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"# 当前文件夹下什么也没有\n~ » ll\ntotal 0\n# 创建一个名为 dir 的空文件夹\n~ » mkdir dir\n~ » ll\ntotal 0\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 xt xt 4.0K Dec  2 21:09 dir\n# 查看 dir 中的内容，没有任何东西，是个空文件夹\n~ » ls dir","language":"bash","uuid":"bf455b4e-2e99-4238-bca8-d55f114c4c2b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有的时候我们想创建一个深层次的文件夹，例如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dir1/dir2/dir3","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dir1/dir2/","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 下创建 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dir3","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我们尝试使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"mkdir","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令进行创建"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"~ » mkdir dir1/dir2/dir3\nmkdir: cannot create directory ‘dir1/dir2/dir3’: No such file or directory","language":"bash","uuid":"914f6ad8-300e-419d-bd85-a9a8da90ecc2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是失败了，因为不存在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dir1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dir1/dir2","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这两个文件夹，所以无法创建 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dir3","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以我们必须先创建 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dir1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dir2","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，然后才能创建 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dir3","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"~ » mkdir dir1\n~ » mkdir dir1/dir2\n~ » mkdir dir1/dir2/dir3\n~ » tree .\n.\n├── dir\n└── dir1\n    └── dir2\n        └── dir3\n\n4 directories, 0 files","language":"bash","uuid":"07886bc2-0d0e-433b-80e8-b1f6abb49ced","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这样做虽然实现了目的，但是很累，我们可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"-p","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项来创建文件夹，例如"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"~ » mkdir -p d1/d2/d3\n~ » tree\n.\n├── d1\n│   └── d2\n│       └── d3\n├── dir\n└── dir1\n    └── dir2\n        └── dir3\n\n7 directories, 0 files","language":"bash","uuid":"539f092e-411f-4805-8e26-93153df04509","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"添加了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"-p","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项之后，如果我们要创建的文件夹的父级文件夹不存在，系统则会帮我们创建，也就是说 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"mkdir -p d1/d2/d3","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，虽然 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"d1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"d2","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件夹不存在，但是系统会帮我们自动创建。"}],"disableDrag":false}],"tags":["Linux/命令/mkdir"],"createTime":1689087324435,"updateTime":1745155356076,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1745155356076}}